title: Fake browser update
severity: critical
score: 70
tags: fake-update, malware-download
attack: T1189, T1204.002, T1036.005
description: A non-vendor page shows a browser/software update lure and either downloads (or
  tries to download) a risky file, tells the visitor to open the file it delivered, or
  writes a clipboard command (ClearFake / SocGholish / fake Acrobat update).
---
// A fake browser-update page ...
fake_update_pages
// ... with a download, open-the-download steps, a clipboard command or an EtherHiding
// blockchain read (the update script's loader).
| where exists(unprompted_risky_downloads)
    or exists(executable_downloads)
    or exists(open_download_pages)
    or exists(clipboard_commands)
    or exists(etherhiding_reads)
